{"3254320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World Rally Arcade", "steam_appid": 3254320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD RALLY ARCADE</strong> is my <i>first ever game that I've released</i>, and was a summer project for 2024 to see if I could be able to make and release a game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a simple single-player, race to the line game. Attack <strong><i>four different courses</i></strong> as you try to set the fastest time you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You</i></strong> versus the <i>clock...</i> who will come out on <strong><i>top</i></strong>?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD RALLY ARCADE</strong> is my <i>first ever game that I've released</i>, and was a summer project for 2024 to see if I could be able to make and release a game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a simple single-player, race to the line game. Attack <strong><i>four different courses</i></strong> as you try to set the fastest time you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You</i></strong> versus the <i>clock...</i> who will come out on <strong><i>top</i></strong>?</p>", "short_description": "BRINGING THE ARCADE BACK TO RALLY", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254320/header.jpg?t=1776105195", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254320/ca7984c5ae8fac9864e21f131f725479457d4e1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776105195", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254320/ca7984c5ae8fac9864e21f131f725479457d4e1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17761